-- Migration 523: Reporting catalogue entries for the RMM, health check, tray,
-- Windows Update, warranty, AI usage, marketing campaign, custom form, client
-- onboarding and register features added recently. Global reports are named
-- "<Area>: <Report>", company report sections "Report - ...", stat strips
-- "Stat Strip - ..." and dashboard widgets "Dashboard - ..." (X/Y columns).
-- Idempotent via INSERT IGNORE on the unique slug, so administrator edits to
-- an existing entry are never overwritten.
